      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start for my categorization. You mentioned neuroanatomical differences like cranial capacity and brain structure. To be really thorough in my paper, could you elaborate on the specific arguments they make regarding how those physical brain differences are supposed to translate into the cognitive or behavioral differences they observe? I'm trying to map out the exact logic they use to link physical anatomy to things like IQ or social behavior.",
